{"id":"n49276-2-8","stage":5,"title":"탓 · 怪罪","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n49276-2-8-1","ko":"너랑 어제 싸우는 바람에 중요한 시험을 망쳤어.","zh":"因为昨天和你吵架，我搞砸了重要的考试。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너랑","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；랑：连接并列名词，表示“和”。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어제","meaning":"昨天，昨日","explanation":"어제：昨天，昨日","readings":[{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67075","senseId":"1","lemma":"어제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"싸우는","meaning":"打架，争斗","explanation":"싸우다：打架，争斗；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"싸우다","audio":"/audio/e27f0e273d4af17d7ed1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29732","senseId":"1","lemma":"싸우다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"바람에","meaning":"表示后句的理由或原因。","explanation":"바람：表示后句的理由或原因。；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"바람","audio":"/audio/9ec024bb0ceb6fd21e9a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58172","senseId":"1","lemma":"바람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"중요한","meaning":"重要","explanation":"중요하다：重要；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"중요하다","audio":"/audio/09f31215bf005060eaf0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91873","senseId":"1","lemma":"중요하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"시험을","meaning":"考试","explanation":"시험：考试；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"시험","audio":"/audio/ff65dc582ce71198934b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20233","senseId":"1","lemma":"시험","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"망쳤어.","meaning":"搞砸，毁灭","explanation":"망치다：搞砸，毁灭；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"망치다","audio":"/audio/828d7effc3bc90f96ba0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15941","senseId":"1","lemma":"망치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"79c5ada11647bce6","term":"어제","zh":"昨天，昨日","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3","entryId":"67075","definition":"今天的前一天。","pronunciation":["어제"]},{"id":"e27f0e273d4af17d","term":"싸우다","zh":"打架，争斗","audio":"/audio/e27f0e273d4af17d7ed1.mp3","entryId":"29732","definition":"想要获胜而用语言或力气等进行较量。","pronunciation":["싸우다"]},{"id":"9ec024bb0ceb6fd2","term":"바람","zh":"表示后句的理由或原因。","audio":"/audio/9ec024bb0ceb6fd21e9a.mp3","entryId":"58172","definition":"表示后句的理由或原因。","pronunciation":["바람"]},{"id":"09f31215bf005060","term":"중요하다","zh":"重要","audio":"/audio/09f31215bf005060eaf0.mp3","entryId":"91873","definition":"贵重且必不可缺。","pronunciation":["중ː요하다"]},{"id":"ff65dc582ce71198","term":"시험","zh":"考试","audio":"/audio/ff65dc582ce71198934b.mp3","entryId":"20233","definition":"按照问题、提问、实际行动等一定程序考核考生的知识或能力的事宜。","pronunciation":["시험"]},{"id":"828d7effc3bc90f9","term":"망치다","zh":"搞砸，毁灭","audio":"/audio/828d7effc3bc90f96ba0.mp3","entryId":"15941","definition":"使之灭亡或把其完全弄坏。","pronunciation":["망치다"]}],"audio":"/audio/2992dc609f4a014e32f5.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n49276-2-8-2","ko":"넌 언제나 남 탓만 하는구나.","zh":"你总是把错都推到别人身上啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"넌","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"언제나","meaning":"一直，总是","explanation":"언제나：一直，总是","readings":[{"term":"언제나","audio":"/audio/84e71f1184644498ff69.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67285","senseId":"1","lemma":"언제나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"남","meaning":"别人，他人，人家","explanation":"남：别人，他人，人家","readings":[{"term":"남","audio":"/audio/e43a28aa552de4826029.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28394","senseId":"1","lemma":"남","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"탓만","meaning":"怪罪","explanation":"탓：怪罪；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"탓","audio":"/audio/b2c2283ffa6c47e2d60c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49276","senseId":"2","lemma":"탓","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하는구나.","meaning":"做（남 탓을 하다：责怪别人、归咎于别人）","explanation":"하다：做（남 탓을 하다：责怪别人、归咎于别人）；는구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"84e71f1184644498","term":"언제나","zh":"一直，总是","audio":"/audio/84e71f1184644498ff69.mp3","entryId":"67285","definition":"无论何时；或指不管什么时候都没变地。","pronunciation":["언ː제나"]},{"id":"e43a28aa552de482","term":"남","zh":"别人，他人，人家","audio":"/audio/e43a28aa552de4826029.mp3","entryId":"28394","definition":"除我之外的其他人。","pronunciation":["남"]},{"id":"b2c2283ffa6c47e2","term":"탓","zh":"怪罪","audio":"/audio/b2c2283ffa6c47e2d60c.mp3","entryId":"49276","definition":"由于事情不如意，就作为借口责备或埋怨自己认为原因所在的人或事物。","pronunciation":["탇"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做（남 탓을 하다：责怪别人、归咎于别人）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"做（남 탓을 하다：责怪别人、归咎于别人）","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/b5095cf25ba1931f13bc.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.404,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=49276","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"고급","day":163,"sequenceScore":3.2307,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["你总是把错都推到别人身上啊。","从这里到上面的村子要花多长时间呢？","因为昨天和你吵架，我搞砸了重要的考试。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你总是把错都推到别人身上啊。","因为昨天和你吵架，我搞砸了重要的考试。","从这里到上面的村子要花多长时间呢？"],"answer":0}]}
